#note "Only TSEQAG1 is present, a member of TSEQAGy. The Check's count(find_vars('TSEQAGy')) == 0 term is false, so the rule runs and passes (Q13 of PLAN-dynamic-column-functions — the template moved from Requirements.Variables.None into the Check; this dataset used to be SKIPPED): a treatment variable of that family exists, and a BDS dataset need not carry the family's first member."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col TSEQAG1 type=Char
